      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Just west of Richmond, Montrose evolved from a rural area into a suburban community shaped by the capital’s expansion.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/montrose-45272",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town sits amid rolling hills, offering views of nearby historic sites that echo Virginia’s colonial past.",
